- **Labour Force Survey (LFS): mandatory.** Participation is mandatory for adults under the authority of the Statistics Act.
- **Canadian Income Survey (CIS): voluntary.** Statistics Canada says responding is voluntary. The CIS is given to a sub-sample of LFS respondents. It also uses tax data from the Canada Revenue Agency.

Source: Statistics Canada Integrated Metadata Database (IMDB), survey records 3701 (LFS) and 5200 (CIS). The CIS record shows a collection period of 2026-01-18 to 2026-07-07, for the 2025 reference year. These are survey records, so there is no table or vector number.

